@startuml componentes-rpg-en

left to right direction
'skinparam componentStyle rectangle
'skinparam linetype ortho

' --- Componentes ---
component "Onboarding &\nIn-Game Help" as OnboardingHelp
component "Progression" as Progression
component "Difficulty\nAdjustment" as DifficultyAdjustment
component "Competition &\nRankings" as CompetitionRankings
component "Game Persistence\n(Saves/Loads)" as Persistence
component "Inventory\n& Item Collection" as InventoryCollection
component "Observability\n(Telemetry, Logs, Audit)" as Observability
component "Moderation" as Moderation
component "Real-Time\nBug Feedback" as FeedbackBugs
component "Updates &\nDeployment" as Updates
component "Internal Tools\n(QA/Cheats)" as InternalTools

' --- Relationships (with dashed arrows when there is dependency) ---
Progression ..> DifficultyAdjustment : uses\nlevels/curves
CompetitionRankings ..> DifficultyAdjustment : uses\nlevels/curves
Progression ..> Persistence : saves/restores\nprogress
InventoryCollection ..> Persistence : saves/restores\nitems
CompetitionRankings ..> Persistence : saves/queries\nrankings
Progression ..> Observability : emits\nmetrics/events
InventoryCollection ..> Observability : emits\nmetrics/events
CompetitionRankings ..> Observability : emits\nmetrics/events
Persistence ..> Observability : emits\nlogs/errors
Moderation ..> Observability : queries\nlogs/usage data
FeedbackBugs ..> Updates : reports bugs

Updates --> OnboardingHelp : delivers\ncontent/patches
Updates --> Progression : deploys\nrules/challenges
Updates --> DifficultyAdjustment : deploys\ncurves/parameters
Updates --> CompetitionRankings : deploys\nevents/rules
Updates --> InventoryCollection : deploys\nitems/balancing
Updates --> Observability : deploys\nagents/collection
Updates --> Persistence : migrations/scripts

InternalTools ..> Progression : warp/unlocks
InternalTools ..> Persistence : forces\nstates/snapshots
' --- Requested corrections ---
OnboardingHelp ..> Persistence : saves\nprogress/tutorial
Observability --> FeedbackBugs : feeds\nalerts

@enduml
